<title>GERMANY: VW says likely to release H1 results Monday.</title>
<headline>VW says likely to release H1 results Monday.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen AG said on Friday it would probably release its first half results on Monday afternoon, August 18.</p>
<p>Analysts expect the carmaker to report group net profit of around 500 million marks during the first half of 1997 compared with 282 million marks during the first half of last year.</p>
<p>In 1996, VW group net profit doubled to 678 million marks and sales climbed 14 percent to 100.1 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
